WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.103
THE JUSTICE
DEPARTMENT HAS SAID IT PLANS TO

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:07.807
APPEAL A COURT-ORDERED SPECIAL
MASTER TO REVIEW THE MATERIALS

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:11.945
SEIZED BY THE FBI AT MAR-A-LAGO,
PRESIDENT TRUMP'S BEACH HOME.

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:17.350
THE DOJ IS ACTUALLY FILING A
MOTION WITH A FEDERAL JUDGE

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:21.921
CARVING OUT PART OF HER RULING,
SAYING THAT THE FBI SHOULD BE

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:26.092
ABLE TO LOOK AT CLASSIFIED
DOCUMENTS THAT WERE SEIZED

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:30.663
THERE.
WITH US NOW CNN LEGAL ANALYST

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:35.535
NORM EISEN, THE HOUSE JUDICIARY
COMMITTEE'S SPECIAL COUNSEL

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.470
DURING DONALD TRUMP'S FIRST
IMPEACHMENT TRIAL.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.639
I KNOW YOU AGREE WITH WHAT THE
JUSTICE DEPARTMENT IS DOING

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:44.777
HERE, I KNOW YOU DISAGREE WITH
JUDGE CANON'S ORIGINAL RULING.

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:47.747
CAN YOU EXPLAIN EXACTLY WHAT
THEY'RE ASKING HERE?

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:51.317
IT'S AN INTERESTING CARVEOUT.
&gt;&gt; JOHN, THANKS FOR HAVING ME

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:53.019
BACK.
YES, THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT IS

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:58.458
SAYING TO JUDGE CANNON, WE'RE
NOT GOING TO APPEAL RIGHT NOW

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:02.762
YOUR DECISION TO APPOINT A
SPECIAL MASTER OR PROHIBIT US

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:08.401
FROM USING THE 11,000
NONCLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS, BUT FOR

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:13.239
A SMALL SUBSET OF DOCUMENTS THAT
WERE SEIZED BY THE JUSTICE

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:19.279
DEPARTMENT WHEN IT EXECUTED ITS
SEARCH WARRANT AT MAR-A-LAGO A

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:23.550
BIT OVER 100 DOCUMENTS THEY'RE
SAYING, JUDGE, DON'T STOP US

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:29.422
FROM USING THESE WHILE WE
INVES

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:33.693
INVESTIGATE, ISSUE A STAY OF
YOUR EARLIER ORDER SO THAT WE

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:38.030
CAN APPEAL THIS TO THE 11th
CIRCUIT.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:40.200
THEY'VE GIVEN UP ON HER, THEY
ARE NOT ASKING HER TO

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.703
RECONSIDER, THEY'RE GOING TO GO
UP ON APPEAL BUT IN THE MEANTIME

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:46.039
THEY SAY DON'T TIE OUR HANDS ON
THESE DOCUMENTS, IT'S DANGEROUS

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:48.841
TO NATIONAL SECURITY.
&gt;&gt; SO WHY?

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:51.244
WHY THESE DOCUMENTS?
WHAT'S THE JUSTIFICATION TO LET

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:56.883
THEM CONTINUE TO LOOK AT THESE
ROUGHLY, I UNDERSTAND, 100

00:01:56.883 --> 00:02:01.221
DOCUMENTS?
&gt;&gt; WELL, THE JUSTIFICATION IS

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:05.425
THAT THE JUDGE SAID IN HER
EARLIER ORDER, JOHN, THAT SHE

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:08.094
WAS GOING TO BIFURCATE.
SHE WAS GOING TO ALLOW -- THESE

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:12.165
DOCUMENTS ARE SO DANGEROUS AND
WE HAVE TALKED ABOUT THIS AS A

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:14.934
FORMER DIPLOMATE WHO HAD OUR
NATION'S HIGHEST SECURITY

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:18.037
CLEARANCE AND WHO ACTUALLY
WORKED ON THE EXECUTIVE ORDER

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:23.209
THAT THE GOVERNMENT REALIZE UPON
TO MAKE THIS ARGUMENT WHEN I WAS

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:26.579
IN THE WHITE HOUSE, THIS
DIVISION THAT SHE'S MADE MAKES

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:29.782
NO SENSE.
SHE SAYS, HEY, THESE DOCUMENTS

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:34.020
ARE SO DANGEROUS WE'RE GOING TO
ALLOW THE INTELLIGENCE COMMUNITY

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:39.359
TO DO A DAMAGE ASSESSMENT.
ARE WE BURNING THE IDENTITIES OF

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:43.363
SPIES?
ARE WE ENDANGERING AMERICANS OR

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:47.100
OUR ALLIES BY HAVING THESE
DOCUMENTS IN AN INSECURE

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:50.503
LOCATION?
BUT, FBI, DOJ, YOU CAN'T LOOK AT

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:52.772
THEM.
JOHN, THE FBI AND THE DOJ ARE

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:56.042
PART OF THE INTELLIGENCE
COMMUNITY.

00:02:56.042 --> 00:03:01.681
IF IT'S DANGEROUS ENOUGH AND WE
SEEM TO HAVE THAT HERE, THE

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:05.885
ATTORNEY GENERAL AND OTHERS IN
HIS BUILDING NEED TO BOTH DO THE

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:08.655
CRIMINAL INVESTIGATION AND THE
DAMAGE ASSESSMENT.

00:03:08.655 --> 00:03:11.658
THE ATTORNEY GENERAL CAN'T PUT A
WALL UP IN THE MIDDLE OF HIS

00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:13.960
BRAIN.
SO THEY'RE SAYING, HEY, YOUR

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:19.232
ORDER ESSENTIALLY ENDANGERS
NATIONAL SECURITY, PLEASE STAY

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:21.301
THAT PART OF THE ORDER WHILE WE
APPEAL IT.

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:26.839
&gt;&gt; NORM, DOJ IS SAYING THAT THAT
INTELLIGENCE DAMAGE ASSESSMENT

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:31.344
ACTUALLY HAS TO PAUSE.
THAT THESE THINGS ARE TOO

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:35.648
INTERTWINED FOR THAT TO GO ON IF
SHE HAS THIS INJUNCTION.

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:38.851
FIRST OFF, DOES THAT MAKE SENSE
TO YOU?

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:41.120
AND, DO YOU THINK THAT THE JUDGE
IS GOING TO FIND THAT COMPELLING

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.456
ENOUGH THAT SHE'S GOING TO SAY,
OKAY, THAT MAKES SENSE?

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:48.594
&gt;&gt; WELL, BRIANNA, WE HAD A
LITTLE CLUE THAT THE JUDGE IS

00:03:48.594 --> 00:03:53.433
TAKING -- JUDGE CANNON IS TAKING
IT VERY SERIOUSLY BECAUSE AFTER

00:03:53.433 --> 00:04:00.373
DOJ FILED, SHE ORDERED THE
PARTIES IN THE SPECIAL MASTER

00:04:00.373 --> 00:04:03.443
RECOMMENDATIONS, WHO THE SPECIAL
MASTER SHOULD BE AND THE

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:07.480
SO-CALLED ORDER OF OPERATIONS,
HOW THE SPECIAL MASTER WILL

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:10.783
WORK, EVEN THOUGH SHE HASN'T
RULED ON THE STAY MOTION, SHE

00:04:10.783 --> 00:04:17.457
SAID I WANT BOTH PARTIES TO
ADDRESS HOW DOJ'S MOTION WILL

00:04:17.457 --> 00:04:19.325
AFFECT THE CHOICE AND OPERATION
OF THE SPECIAL MASTER.

00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:24.497
SO I THINK THAT'S A TELL THAT
SHE'S TAKING THIS SERIOUSLY.

00:04:24.497 --> 00:04:29.268
BRIANNA, DOJ HAS GIVEN HER A
LIFE LINE.

00:04:29.268 --> 00:04:33.106
THIS IS THE WORST AND MOST
DANGEROUS PART OF HER ORDER AND

00:04:33.106 --> 00:04:36.542
IF SHE'S SMART SHE WILL TAKE IT
AND SHE WILL STAY THIS PART OF

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:39.479
THE ORDER.
I REALLY DO THINK IT JEOPARDIZES

00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:41.314
OUR NATIONAL SECURITY IF SHE
DOESN'T.

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:44.484
&gt;&gt; YEAH, THEY'RE KIND OF SAYING
UNPRETZEL YOURSELF OR WE'RE

00:04:44.484 --> 00:04:47.286
HEADING TO THE 11th CIRCUIT FOR
AN ACTUAL APPEAL HERE.

00:04:47.286 --> 00:04:50.290
NORM, GREAT TO HAVE YOU ON.
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

